ly, integrate the word-dropout augmentation into the training loop by modifying the Dataset's __getitem__ to apply random token dropout. Evaluate similarly and generate submission using the best model. Keep early stopping, optimizer, scheduler, and loss function unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
